flowchart LR
    U[User] -->|Scan QR and confirm phrase| P[Android App]
    U -->|Fingerprint| BP[Android BiometricPrompt]
    BP -->|Success authorizes one key operation| KS[Android Keystore\nEC P-256 private key]

    PC[Windows PC Agent] -->|mDNS discovery / local BLE| P
    PC -->|Pairing QR: pc_id, public key, expiry| QR[QR Pairing Payload]
    QR --> P
    P -->|Phone public key + signed pairing confirmation| PC

    PC -->|Fresh nonce + account binding + expiry| C[Local authenticated channel\nTLS over Wi-Fi; BLE optional]
    C --> P
    P -->|Biometric approval| BP
    KS -->|ECDSA signature over canonical challenge| P
    P -->|Signed unlock response| C
    C --> PC

    PC --> V[Verify signature, nonce, expiry,\naccount binding, single-use challenge]
    V -->|Valid only| A[Supported Windows auth adapter]
    A --> WH[Windows Hello / approved\ncompanion integration]
    V -->|Invalid| F[Fail closed; retain normal sign-in]

    classDef trust fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#2457a6,color:#111;
    classDef sensitive fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#9a6700,color:#111;
    classDef decision fill:#e8f7ee,stroke:#26734d,color:#111;
    class P,KS,PC,C trust;
    class BP,QR sensitive;
    class V,A,WH,F decision;
